# Agent tooling. Nothing under .claude/ is project content in this repository: it holds per-machine tool
# settings and the disposable git worktrees sessions check out. If shared configuration is ever committed
# here, switch this to `.claude/*` with explicit negations, because git will not descend into an ignored
# directory to honour one.
.claude/

# IDE and OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Secrets and keys
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
